WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.872
External text can contain instructions aimed at the model.

00:00:03.872 --> 00:00:10.782
That text may come from users, retrieved documents, web pages, or uploaded files.

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:18.812
Treat it as untrusted content and enforce permissions and security rules in application code rather than relying on the

00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:24.972
model to protect itself. A stronger system prompt alone is not a complete defense.

00:00:24.972 --> 00:00:30.600
Security-sensitive actions must be restricted by software controls outside the model.
